
# The Blog Site

## Project Description
The Blog Site is a responsive website developed using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

## Pages
- Home
- About Us
- Contact Us

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Git and GitHub

## Features
- Responsive navigation menu
- Blog cards with images
- About Us information
- Contact form
- Common footer across all pages

## Project Management
This project follows the SCRUM methodology.
Tasks are organized using GitHub Issues and Projects.

## Team
Our Scrum Development Team
